{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00127","headline":"过王濬暮 · 明皇帝","name":"过王濬暮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴国分牛斗，晋室命龙骧。\n受任敌已灭，策勳名不彰。\n居美未尽善，矜功徒自伤。\n长戟今何在？孤坟此路傍。\n不观松柏茂，空余荆棘场。\n叹嗟悬劒陇，谁识梦刀祥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}